   "title": "ENGINE - LTX-2.5 two-pass",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "ENGINE: LTX-2.5 MULTISHOT sampler.\n\nOne node = the whole two-pass pipeline per shot (pass 1, latent upscale x2/x1.5, pass 2, decode) plus the join. overlap = latent frames of the previous shot pinned at the head of the next (3 = 0.7 s, trimmed on output). identity_ref / identity_strength = same people across shots. seed_per_shot varies the seed by shot. save_every_shot writes raw shots to output/video/JOYLTX_SHOTS. Optional: shot_images (one image per shot, cut/fresh) if you have plates."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
