   "widgets_values": [
    "THE WRITER\n\nlong_story (multi-shot): writes SHOTS prompts, each sized to the seconds per shot. join style \"extend take\" = one continuous speech across shots (use with continue); \"cuts\" or \"continuous scene with cuts\" = each shot its own beat (use with cut / fresh).\nCloud model returned 503 / empty? Pick another model and Run again.\nNo writer? mode = passthrough and paste shot prompts separated by --- into the sampler's prompts box."
